# 112. ANTI-DUPLICATE RULE

```text
RULE 01
One Reward_ID can only be processed once.

RULE 02
One Loot_Roll_ID can only be processed once.

RULE 03
One Dungeon Completion can only generate
its completion reward once.

RULE 04
One Quest Completion can only generate
its completion reward once.

RULE 05
One Transaction_ID can only be committed once.

RULE 06
One Recruitment_ID can only be processed once.

RULE 07
One Recruitment Request can only execute
one RNG result.

RULE 08
Retry must use the same Transaction_ID.

RULE 09
Failed transactions must be rolled back.

RULE 10
Successful transactions must be idempotent.

RULE 11
Gem and Ticket cannot be deducted twice
for the same Recruitment_ID.

RULE 12
Insufficient resource requests must not
execute RNG or generate a result.
```

